# Figure 7.1: Website order and M-Pesa STK payment.
participant C "Customer\n(browser)"
participant W "Website"
participant DB "PostgreSQL\n(RPC, triggers)"
participant CC "customer-checkout"
participant D "Safaricom\nDaraja"
participant WH "mpesa-webhook"

C -> W: Add products, choose delivery area
W -> DB: place_online_order(items, zone ...)
note DB: prices, delivery fee and points\ncomputed on the server; total floored to KSh
DB --> W: order (unpaid)
C -> W: Pay with M-Pesa
W -> CC: action "pay" (customer JWT)
CC -> CC: rate limit: 6 per 10 min per customer
CC -> DB: begin_order_payment()
CC -> D: STK push (stkpush/v1/processrequest)
D --> CC: CheckoutRequestID
CC -> DB: record_order_checkout()
CC --> W: "Check your phone"
D --> C: PIN prompt on handset
C --> D: enters M-Pesa PIN
D --> WH: callback ?token=MPESA_CALLBACK_TOKEN
WH -> DB: confirm_online_order_payment()
note DB: inserts a transactions row: stock, points\nand money-asset triggers run; anomalies flagged
W -> CC: action "check" (polling)
CC --> W: paid / failed / waiting
